d custody root;\n- freezes the pre-resolution ledger, exact packet membership/hashes, agreement set, and safe-rejection set before finalization;\n- validates and imports the three fresh checker/resolver receipt dialects fail-closed;\n- publishes only additive superseding authority under `batch003-verification-chain-integrity-repair-1666`.\n\nThe user-visible/data-integrity effect is that no Batch003 row can enter verified staging with an omitted disagreement field, unverified checker identity, an unmaterialized raw-response hash claim, or a mutable pre-resolution authority.\n\n## Fresh authority and conservation\n\n- 217 fresh primary visual reads\n- 170 fresh independent second reads\n- 387 raw checker responses byte-verified\n- 168 independent resolver decisions\n- 165 `resolver_verified`\n- 47 `verified_agreement`\n- 5 `safe_rejection`\n- equation: `217 = 165 + 47 + 5`\n- 0 unresolved\n- 0 provider/external/paid VLM calls\n- 0 semantic, KG, canonical, production, public, or downstream writes\n\nThe four confirmed incomplete-comparison rows now carry the exact complete field union: `owner_paths`, `node_roles`, `mark_ownership`, and `printed_marks`.\n\nPre-resolution authority SHA-256: `be3edf5c649ac090611f1793c8562c7646f74e594d762373415fe6c02b315b9e`  \nAdditive artifact manifest SHA-256: `fbc0e6e2255ab3085858cdc5a10856c90fce97ec5f97a2e24db50dedf906fe7d`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/vlm/issue_1666_prepare_fresh_resolution.mjs prepare` — PASS, idempotent\n- `node scripts/vlm/issue_1666_finalize_fresh_resolution.mjs finalize` — PASS, idempotent\n- `node --test scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1661_resolution.test.mjs scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1666_verification_chain_integrity.test.mjs` — 10/10 PASS\n- `PYTHONPATH=. .../.venv/bin/python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1661_structural_batch_003.test.py` — 4/4 PASS\n- `PYTHONPATH=. .../.venv/bin/python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1662_same_page_boundary_repair.test.py` — 13/13 PASS\n- `PYTHONPATH=. .../.venv/bin/python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1661_resume_after_1662.test.py` — 6/6 PASS\n- `npm run 9709:full-corpus-freeze:test` — 23/23 PASS\n- targeted ESLint — PASS\n- `git diff --check` — PASS\n\nMerged Batch001, Batch002, and Batch003 artifact roots are unchanged. Batch004 remains blocked pending independent exact-head review, merge, and exact-main readback.\n","created_at":"2026-07-22T08:31:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T09:47:41Z","closed_at":"2026-07-22T09:45:28Z","merged_at":"2026-07-22T09:45:28Z","merge_commit_sha":"bedb3b71aebe2a4ba984e3b1eca529da7652c2e1","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1669/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1669/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1669/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/c944cb30352d3f60c54a513a9cfb1f1d17425ce0","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1666-9709-batch003-verification-chain-integrity-repair","ref":"task/1666-9709-batch003-verification-chain-integrity-repair","sha":"c944cb30352d3f60c54a513a9cfb1f1d17425ce0","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organization